---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Timeline from '../components/Timeline.astro';
import OldDesignGallery from '../components/OldDesignGallery.astro';
import Testimonial from '../components/Testimonial.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import StaticMap from '../components/StaticMap.astro';
import { site, yearsInBusiness, mapsUrl } from '../lib/site';

const work = await getCollection('work')
const quote = work.find((w) => w.id === 'cheezie-chews')

const principles = [
  {
    title: 'We won’t oversell you',
    body: 'Every project we take on has to genuinely help your business, and we are honest about what you need and don’t need.',
  },
  {
    title: 'We agree on the price before work begins',
    body: 'Once the scope is clear, you get a written proposal and a fixed price. If the scope needs to change later, we discuss it with you first.',
  },
  {
    title: 'We build relationships that last',
    body: 'We want to remain useful after launch. Several of our client relationships have lasted for decades and through multiple generations of their websites.',
  },
  {
    title: 'We choose tools deliberately',
    body: 'We select platforms, frameworks, and services for the work they need to do. We explain the tradeoffs instead of forcing every project onto the same technology.',
  },
]

const stats = [
  { value: '1995', label: 'Founded in Albuquerque' },
  { value: String(yearsInBusiness), count: yearsInBusiness, label: 'Years in continuous practice' },
  { value: '500+', count: 500, suffix: '+', label: 'Websites built' },
  { value: '20+', count: 20, suffix: '+', label: 'Years with our longest clients' },
]

const aboutSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'AboutPage',
  name: `About ${site.name}`,
  description: `MIS, Inc. was founded by Karim Ardalan in Albuquerque, New Mexico in July 1995.`,
  mainEntity: { '@id': `${site.url}/#organization` },
}
---

<Base
  title="About MIS, Inc. | Albuquerque Web Design Since 1995"
  description="MIS, Inc. is an Albuquerque web design, software, and AI studio founded by Karim Ardalan in July 1995. Learn how we work and why we have stayed small."
  schema={aboutSchema}
>
  <div class="border-b border-line">
    <PageHero eyebrow="About" title={`${yearsInBusiness} years in one city`} lede="MIS, Inc. was founded by Karim Ardalan in Albuquerque in July 1995, back when most businesses were still deciding whether they needed a website at all. We have been building them ever since." media={{
        type: 'image',
        src: '/img/office-marquette.avif',
        width: 1280,
        height: 852,
        alt: 'The office building at 500 Marquette Avenue NW in downtown Albuquerque, where MIS, Inc. is based',
        caption: '500 Marquette Ave NW, Downtown Albuquerque',
      }} ctas={[
        { label: 'Book a free consultation', href: '/free-consultation' },
        { label: 'See our projects', href: '/portfolio', variant: 'ghost' },
      ]} layout="background" overlayOpacity={95} contrastPanel />
  </div>

  <div class="border-b border-line bg-paper-tint">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {
        stats.map((s) => (
          <div class="px-5 py-6 text-center" data-reveal>
            <b
              class="block font-display text-[32px] font-bold tabular-nums text-primary"
              data-count={s.count}
              data-suffix={s.suffix}
            >
              {s.value}
            </b>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-(--tracking-label) text-ink-muted">
              {s.label}
            </span>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Story -->
  <Section>
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_300px]">
      <div data-reveal>
        <SectionHeader eyebrow="How we got here" title="We started before Google did" class="mb-6" />

        <div class="max-w-[68ch] text-ink-soft">
          <p class="mb-4">
            In July 1995, a website was something you had to explain to people. Karim Ardalan founded
            MIS to build them for Albuquerque businesses that could see where things were going.
            The tools and expectations have changed many times since, but the work still begins by
            understanding what a client actually needs.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4">
            What has kept the studio going since is not any particular technology. It is that every
            few years the web reinvents itself, and someone has to work out which of the changes
            actually matter for a small business and which are noise. We have made that call through
            the dial-up era, the CMS era, the mobile shift, the platform era, and now AI.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We have stayed deliberately small. That is a choice, not a stage we are trying to grow
            out of. A studio this size means the person who understands your business is the person
            writing the code, and it means we can afford to turn down work that is not a good fit.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today we work mostly with New Mexico small businesses and nonprofits, alongside clients
            further afield who have been with us long enough that distance stopped mattering.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-line-soft bg-paper-panel p-6 shadow-card"
          data-reveal
        >
          <!-- TODO(photo): a portrait of Karim would strengthen this considerably.
               Drop one at /img/karim.jpg and uncomment the <img> below. -->
          <!--
          <img
            src="/img/karim.jpg"
            alt="Karim Ardalan, founder of MIS, Inc."
            class="mb-4 aspect-square w-full rounded-md object-cover"
          />
          -->
          <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-(--tracking-label) text-ink-muted">
            Who you will work with
          </span>
          <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink">Karim Ardalan</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-muted">Founder</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-soft">
            Karim founded MIS in 1995 and leads the studio’s client work. If you book a consultation,
            this is who you will speak with and who will be doing or directing the work.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">
            <a
              href={site.phoneHref}
              class="font-bold text-ink-soft no-underline hover:text-primary">{site.phone}</a
            ><br />
            <a
              href={`mailto:${site.email}`}
              class="font-bold text-ink-soft no-underline hover:text-primary">{site.email}</a
            >
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12" data-reveal>
      <span class="mb-4 block text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-(--tracking-label) text-ink-muted">
        What we’ve built since 1995
      </span>
      <OldDesignGallery />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- Timeline -->
  <Section variant="tint" width="full">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-(--container-content) px-6 py-14 md:px-10 lg:py-20">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="Since 1995"
        title="We’ve built through every era of the web"
        lede="Some of our client relationships are older than many web studios. Each shift arrived with a mix of genuine change and expensive nonsense, and separating the two has been the actual job."
        class="mb-10"
      />
      <Timeline />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- Principles -->
  <Section>
    <SectionHeader
      eyebrow="How we work"
      title="Four things we will not compromise on"
      lede="These are the standards every client gets, whether it’s your first project with us or we have worked together for years."
      class="mb-10"
    />

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {
        principles.map((p, i) => (
          <div
            class="flex gap-5 rounded-lg border border-line-soft bg-paper-panel p-6 shadow-card"
            data-reveal
          >
            <span class="grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-paper-surface font-display text-base font-bold text-primary tabular-nums">
              {i + 1}
            </span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="mb-2 font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">{p.title}</h3>
              <p class="text-[15.5px] text-ink-soft">{p.body}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    {
      quote?.data.testimonial && (
        <Testimonial
          variant="inline"
          quote={quote.data.testimonial.quote}
          attribution={quote.data.testimonial.attribution}
          href={`/works/${quote.id}`}
          class="mt-10"
        />
      )
    }
  </Section>

  <!-- Local -->
  <Section variant="tint" width="full">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-(--container-content) px-6 py-14 md:px-10 lg:py-20">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-14">
        <div data-reveal>
          <SectionHeader
            eyebrow="Albuquerque, New Mexico"
            title="Let’s meet in person"
            class="mb-0"
          />
          <div class="mt-4 max-w-[62ch] text-ink-soft">
            <p class="mb-4">
              We are in downtown Albuquerque at 500 Marquette NW. We prefer meeting local clients in person, whether that is at your office, ours, or one of Albuquerque’s many excellent coffee shops. Visits to our office are by appointment.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-6">
              Working downtown keeps us close to the businesses and organizations we serve. We know the city, we understand the value of being able to meet face to face, and we know that Balloon Fiesta week is not a normal week for anyone in Albuquerque.
            </p>
            <address class="not-italic text-ink-soft">
              <strong class="text-ink">{site.name}</strong><br />
              {site.address.street}<br />
              {site.address.city}, {site.address.region} {site.address.postalCode}<br />
              <a href={site.phoneHref} class="font-bold text-ink-soft no-underline hover:text-primary">
                {site.phone}
              </a>
            </address>

            <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3.5">
              <Button href="/free-consultation">Book a free consultation</Button>
              <Button href="/contact" variant="ghost">Contact us</Button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href={mapsUrl}
          class="block overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line-soft shadow-card"
          aria-label="Open our location in Google Maps"
          data-reveal
        >
          <StaticMap height="320px" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section divider={false}>
    <CtaBand
      title="Let’s talk about your project."
      note={`No pressure. Clear recommendations. ${yearsInBusiness} years of seeing what works.`}
    />
  </Section>
</Base>
